ICU4C
-----

Charr bundles ICU4C 78.3 source code and data from Unicode, Inc. and others.
The primary notice is copyright (c) 2016-2025 Unicode, Inc. under the Unicode
License v3, SPDX identifier Unicode-3.0. ICU also contains components with
their own copyright holders and compatible terms.

The complete Unicode License v3 and every third-party notice supplied with
ICU4C 78.3 are included in `icu/LICENSE` in the installed package and
`src/icu78/LICENSE` in the repository and source package. Those files are
retained verbatim from ICU's distribution.

Charr carries seven small source adjustments for compiler diagnostics and
portability. They do not alter ICU's license terms. The adjusted files and
changes are listed under "Source-package adjustments" in the repository's
`tools/icu78/README.md`; source archive hashes and data provenance are recorded
in `src/icu78/UPSTREAM.md`.

