Tatoeba
-------

Charr's benchmark measures against sentences from the Tatoeba Project
(<https://tatoeba.org>), released under Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 France
with attribution to Tatoeba. Some sentences are additionally available under
CC0 1.0, and sentences from the Tanaka Corpus are in the public domain.

No Tatoeba data is included in this package or in its repository. The benchmark
reads a sentence export the maintainer supplies locally, and the corpus it
derives from that export is untracked.

External package dependencies
-----------------------------

Charr calls the installed stringi package for its reference backend and uses
the installed charport package for ALTREP interoperability. Those package
distributions are not bundled in charr and retain their own licenses. This
does not change the notices above for stringi-derived source that is included
directly in charr.
